Z||000000||85Josh||03-01-2001||06:41 PM||||This morning, my 85 4cyl,5speed wouldn't let me go into reverse. I took off all the console (ARRGHH, all the screw holes in the plastic are cracked! Oh,well, different topic there.), and found that the shifter moves freely after I took off the cables, but the select cable only moves in one direction. Moving to the back of the car, I can grab the lever that the select cable connects to and move it down, but not up. The question is, what could have gotten stuck (the car went into reverse last night), and how do I get it loose. Thanks for any leads.<P>------------------<BR>85 2M4<BR>CAVALRY SCOUT!||||reg||1
Z||000001||Wolfhound||03-01-2001||08:00 PM||||Check to see if you have also lost 5th. If so it,s a broken select cable. It will give you 1st, 2nd, 3rd, and 4th even if broken. ||||reg||1
